    "reason": "[ev-ebd92acd21f4] is one step of a local procedure: copy your config into `loki-config.yaml` in an empty directory, then \"Run this command from that directory\" [ev-45ef39303832]. It is a convenience step for running a command, not a change in Loki 3.0.0. Nothing in the evidence says this file preparation is a required upgrade migration or that skipping it breaks anything. The actual 3.0 migrations, such as TSDB/v13 [ev-6650fd33304c][ev-5dacaee98643], are separate changes, so naming this step as its own migration-required subject misreads the text.",
